# Thieves Guild: Gentleman Jim Stacey's war on the Camonna Tong, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller, Vivec (Stacey =
# 05D48791). His "jobs" open at Captain (rank 6) and offer, in order: Nads Tharen (the key), help us fight (Percius
# Mercius, Ald'ruhn Fighters Guild: 50, "Continue" 2: 60, "Continue" 1: 70), Bitter Cup (Eydis Fire-Eye, Balmora
# Fighters Guild), Hrundi's woman (Falena Hlaren at Fara's: 60; Hrundi, Wolverine Hall, "join our cause": 70). Their
# 5 each make 100 reputation: Mastermind (rank 8), which his last two need -- the Ienith brothers here (Ranes is
# placed at the player by Navil's script when the player first hits Navil) and Sjoring Hard-Heart (0150, after the
# Bal Molagmer: staceyScript disables Stacey once Hard-Heart's job is done).
# AddItem stands in for the finds (Nads Tharen's key, the Bitter Cup); SetDisposition for persuading Percius (60)
# and Falena (50); `punch` + `defend` for the Ienith fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_nads_tharen
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask Nads Tharen
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BrotherThief == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem key_tgbt 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Nads Tharen
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BrotherThief == 100
bye
end

case tg_enemy_parley
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask help us fight
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EnemyParley == 10
bye
run
"persius mercius"->SetDisposition 60
player->PositionCell 1493 -240 -752 0 "Ald-ruhn, Guild of Fighters"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, Guild of Fighters" == 1
approach 052FE173
talk persius mercius
ask help us fight
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EnemyParley == 50
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EnemyParley == 60
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EnemyParley == 70
bye
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask help us fight
expect GetJournalIndex TG_EnemyParley == 100
bye
end

case tg_bitter_bribe
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask Bitter Cup
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BitterBribe == 10
bye
run
player->AddItem artifact_bittercup_01 1
player->PositionCell 241 110 140 0 "Balmora, Guild of Fighters"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Guild of Fighters" == 1
approach 052A98A9
talk eydis fire-eye
ask Bitter Cup
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BitterBribe == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Bitter Cup
expect GetJournalIndex TG_BitterBribe == 100
bye
end

case tg_hostage
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask Hrundi's woman
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Hostage == 10
bye
run
"falena hlaren"->SetDisposition 50
player->PositionCell 213 0 395 0 "Sadrith Mora, Fara's Hole in the Wall"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Fara's Hole in the Wall" == 1
approach 05DE6499
talk falena hlaren
ask Hrundi's woman
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Hostage == 60
bye
run
player->PositionCell 55 140 10 0 "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Fighter's Guild"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Wolverine Hall: Fighter's Guild" == 1
approach 05A02138
talk hrundi
ask join our cause
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Hostage == 70
bye
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Hrundi's woman
expect GetJournalIndex TG_Hostage == 100
bye
end

# 100 reputation meets rank 8 (Mastermind: 100, Security 80, Sneak 30, Agility and Personality 34).
case tg_stacey_advancement
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Advancement
expect player->GetPCRank "Thieves Guild" == 8
bye
end

case tg_ienith
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask jobs
ask Ienith
expect GetJournalIndex TG_KillIenith == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3807 3500 15448 0 "Dren Plantation, Dren's Villa"
until 300 GetPCCell "Dren Plantation, Dren's Villa" == 1
approach 05D4C924
defend
punch 3 Navil Ienith
until 1500 GetDeadCount "Navil Ienith" >= 1
until 1500 GetDeadCount "Ranes Ienith" >= 1
run
player->PositionCell 6452 -800 -244 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 05D48791
talk stacey
ask Ienith
expect GetJournalIndex TG_KillIenith == 100
bye
end
